    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753420/extras/0ebc5d4172b1d7d9ef1180cc5cb81b41.poster.avif?t=1707347928\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753420/extras/0ebc5d4172b1d7d9ef1180cc5cb81b41.webm?t=1707347928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753420/extras/0ebc5d4172b1d7d9ef1180cc5cb81b41.mp4?t=1707347928\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>   <br><strong><i>Discover a captivating story as you try out to become a Starlight Scout. </i></strong><br>       You were once a prestigious fighter pilot, when fierce battles were waged from planet to planet in the relentless acquisition of newfound resources. Skies were painted with streaks of burnt fuel and space-age shrapnel. You flew primitive rockets with thrusters bolted crudely onto every side and fought ruthlessly just to earn your pay.<br><br>       Now, as the resource wars have dwindled down to space-age scuffles, Rocket-Heroes are a relic of the past. All that's left is your burning desire to get back behind the throttle.<br> <br>       You apply to become a <strong>Starlight Scout</strong>, an explorer of the unknown, a charter of the uncharted, a hero to those planet-side. Master the controls of your state of the art Type I Rocket, a rugged space-craft capable of a multitude of interplanetary missions. Be guided by Maxstric- a Comet Class Starlight Scout- through the Starlight Express, a training ground for aspiring pilots. It won't be easy. Do you have what it takes?<br><br><br><br><strong><i><u>FEATURES</u></i></strong><br>-Simple controls, easy to learn, hard to master. Anyone can try out to be a Scout!<br>-Captivating Story with passionately voiced dialogue.<br>-Characters with deep and unique personalities.<br>-Earn High-Scores based on flight time, fuel expended, collisions sustained, and damage taken, fully realized with a ghost of your fastest run.<br>-Evolved and re-imagined Lunar Lander inspired gameplay.<br>-7 Unique and challenging levels, with free Episodic Updates coming soon.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753420/extras/455f65b40877d95fe2680ff8d3a36b26.poster.avif?t=1707347928\" width=616 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753420/extras/455f65b40877d95fe2680ff8d3a36b26.webm?t=1707347928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753420/extras/455f65b40877d95fe2680ff8d3a36b26.mp4?t=1707347928\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><i>What are you waiting for, Pilot? Let's see what you're made of!</i></strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753420/extras/92b3d8d3a0ffbe4b65b5d76208e67c5d.webp?t=1707347928\" width=616 height=50 /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753420/extras/0ebc5d4172b1d7d9ef1180cc5cb81b41.poster.avif?t=1707347928\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753420/extras/0ebc5d4172b1d7d9ef1180cc5cb81b41.webm?t=1707347928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753420/extras/0ebc5d4172b1d7d9ef1180cc5cb81b41.mp4?t=1707347928\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>   <br><strong><i>Discover a captivating story as you try out to become a Starlight Scout. </i></strong><br>       You were once a prestigious fighter pilot, when fierce battles were waged from planet to planet in the relentless acquisition of newfound resources. Skies were painted with streaks of burnt fuel and space-age shrapnel. You flew primitive rockets with thrusters bolted crudely onto every side and fought ruthlessly just to earn your pay.<br><br>       Now, as the resource wars have dwindled down to space-age scuffles, Rocket-Heroes are a relic of the past. All that's left is your burning desire to get back behind the throttle.<br> <br>       You apply to become a <strong>Starlight Scout</strong>, an explorer of the unknown, a charter of the uncharted, a hero to those planet-side. Master the controls of your state of the art Type I Rocket, a rugged space-craft capable of a multitude of interplanetary missions. Be guided by Maxstric- a Comet Class Starlight Scout- through the Starlight Express, a training ground for aspiring pilots. It won't be easy. Do you have what it takes?<br><br><br><br><strong><i><u>FEATURES</u></i></strong><br>-Simple controls, easy to learn, hard to master. Anyone can try out to be a Scout!<br>-Captivating Story with passionately voiced dialogue.<br>-Characters with deep and unique personalities.<br>-Earn High-Scores based on flight time, fuel expended, collisions sustained, and damage taken, fully realized with a ghost of your fastest run.<br>-Evolved and re-imagined Lunar Lander inspired gameplay.<br>-7 Unique and challenging levels, with free Episodic Updates coming soon.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753420/extras/455f65b40877d95fe2680ff8d3a36b26.poster.avif?t=1707347928\" width=616 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753420/extras/455f65b40877d95fe2680ff8d3a36b26.webm?t=1707347928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753420/extras/455f65b40877d95fe2680ff8d3a36b26.mp4?t=1707347928\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><i>What are you waiting for, Pilot? Let's see what you're made of!</i></strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753420/extras/92b3d8d3a0ffbe4b65b5d76208e67c5d.webp?t=1707347928\" width=616 height=50 /></span>",
